@startuml
title 同济大学校园论坛与站内私聊系统 · 用例图
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #EAF2FA
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F4F8FC
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #355C7D
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #355C7D
actor "账号申请者" as Applicant
actor "已登录账号" as Account <<抽象参与者>>
actor "游客用户" as Guest
actor "普通用户" as Member
actor "VIP 用户" as VIP
actor "版主" as Moderator
actor "管理员" as Admin
actor "同济身份认证服务" as Tongji <<次参与者>>
actor "支付宝" as Alipay <<次参与者>>
actor "微信支付" as Wechat <<次参与者>>
Account <|-- Guest
Account <|-- Member
Account <|-- Admin
Member <|-- VIP
Member <|-- Moderator
rectangle "同济大学校园论坛与站内私聊系统" {
  package "账号与公开讨论" {
    usecase "UC-01\n注册与登录" as UC01
    usecase "UC-02\n维护个人资料" as UC02
    usecase "UC-03\n浏览板块帖子" as UC03
    usecase "UC-04\n发布帖子" as UC04
    usecase "UC-05\n查看帖子详情" as UC05
    usecase "UC-06\n发表评论" as UC06
    usecase "UC-07\n编辑本人帖子" as UC07
    usecase "UC-08\n删除本人内容" as UC08
    usecase "UC-09\n搜索与筛选帖子" as UC09
    usecase "UC-19\n关联同济身份" as UC19
  }
  package "私聊与治理" {
    usecase "UC-10\n发起私聊" as UC10
    usecase "UC-11\n查看会话与历史" as UC11
    usecase "UC-12\n收发文本消息" as UC12
    usecase "UC-13\n查看未读与标记已读" as UC13
    usecase "UC-14\n拉黑与解除拉黑" as UC14
    usecase "UC-15\n提交举报" as UC15
    usecase "UC-16\n处理板块举报" as UC16
    usecase "UC-17\n管理平台与举报" as UC17
    usecase "UC-18\n重试并确认消息结果" as UC18
  }
  package "VIP 与支付" {
    usecase "UC-20\n选择套餐并创建订单" as UC20
    usecase "UC-21\n使用支付宝充值" as UC21
    usecase "UC-22\n使用微信支付充值" as UC22
    usecase "UC-23\n使用金色昵称与主页装扮" as UC23
    usecase "UC-24\n续费及按期限使用权益" as UC24
    usecase "UC-25\n查看订单与会员期限" as UC25
    usecase "UC-26\n核验支付结果并发放权益" as UC26
  }
}
Applicant -- UC01
Account -- UC01
Account -- UC03
Account -- UC05
Guest -- UC19
Member -- UC02
Member -- UC04
Member -- UC06
Member -- UC07
Member -- UC08
Member -- UC09
Member -- UC10
Member -- UC11
Member -- UC12
Member -- UC13
Member -- UC14
Member -- UC15
Member -- UC18
Member -- UC20
Member -- UC21
Member -- UC22
Member -- UC25
VIP -- UC23
Member -- UC24
Moderator -- UC16
Admin -- UC17
UC19 -- Tongji
UC21 -- Alipay
UC22 -- Wechat
UC25 -- Alipay
UC25 -- Wechat
UC26 -- Alipay
UC26 -- Wechat
legend bottom
  五类业务用户：游客、普通、VIP、版主、管理员。
  “已登录账号”仅抽取公共能力；账号申请者表示注册前的参与者。
  主参与者为业务用户；外部认证和支付服务为次参与者。
  UC-26 由支付通知或查单结果触发，平台也可充当触发参与者。
  游客仅能浏览公开帖子和办理身份认证，不能搜索、发帖、评论、私聊或充值。
  VIP 与管理授权独立；管理员使用交流或 VIP 功能时仍须满足对应身份条件。
  连线表示参与关系，不表示调用顺序；安全、性能等质量约束见 SRS。
endlegend
@enduml
